  "findings": [
    "ISBlacksmithMenu local disableFurnaceAnvil=true blocks the constructor menu callbacks. Existing BSFurnace object interaction remains a different branch.",
    "ISAnvil.create sets object name Anvil. RecipeManager.isNearItem compares Recipe.NearItem with nearby IsoObject.getName; sprite appearance alone is insufficient.",
    "SmithingMag1-4 declare learned recipes and are hidden in ISLiteratureUI. No matching active distribution entry was found in the inspected Lua corpus; absence of a text hit is not a world reachability proof.",
